# Brand logo

Single mark file: `public/brand/logo-mark.png` · import via `@/components/BrandLogo` (`BrandLogo` / `BrandLockup` / `BRAND_LOGO_SRC`).

## Rules

- Header, login, account, admin rail, favicon/apple icon — same PNG (or sizes derived from it).
- Do not recreate the mark with CSS gradients / `::after` document shapes.
- Do not drop a different SVG/PNG logo in one page only.
- To change the logo: replace `public/brand/logo-mark.png` (+ keep `public/brand/logo-mark.svg` in sync), then regenerate `src/app/favicon.ico`, `public/favicon.ico`, `src/app/icon.png`, `src/app/apple-icon.png`, `public/favicon-32.png`, `public/favicon-48.png`, `public/icon-192.png`, `public/apple-touch-icon.png` from that file.
- Cursor Recents for `localhost` often shows a generic globe and ignores site favicons — verify the real browser tab after hard refresh, not Recents alone.
